#: hledger-web/templates/default-layout.hamlet
msgid "match any visible field (account, amount, comment, description, code), or a date if REGEX is also a period expression"
msgstr "kūlike me kekahi kahua ʻike ʻia (moʻokālā, nui, manaʻo, wehewehe, helu), a i ʻole he lā inā he huaʻōlelo wā pū ʻo REGEX"

